List measurement methodologies

Usage: vendo measurement methodologies [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list  List methodologies (system + account)
  get   Show one methodology by ID
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics
  -h, --help            Print help
